weight.description:
The weight assigned to each voice. Must be specified together with `voice_id`.
Supported range: `[1, 100]`. Up to 4 voices can be mixed. A higher weight value increases similarity to the corresponding voice.

Parameter Configuration Example:

```json
"timbre_weights": [
  {
    "voice_id": "female-chengshu",
    "weight": 30
  },
  {
    "voice_id": "female-tianmei",
    "weight": 70
  }
]
```
